<title>USA: Franklin, La., won by Crews &amp; Associates.</title>
<headline>Franklin, La., won by Crews &amp; Associates.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crews &amp; Associates said it won $1.675 million of Franklin, La., sales tax revemie bpmds. Series St-1996, with a net interest cost of 5.7245 percent.</p>
